  "Chinotto": "",
  "Chinotto and iPods sort by these instead of the names when they're filled in (for example “Beatles” for “The Beatles”).": "",
  "Chinotto can add songs to this Walkman (drag them onto it in the sidebar, or use Add Songs…), and change and delete them in its Music list. Songs that aren't already MP3 at one of the bitrates below are converted. Its database is backed up on the Walkman, in “Chinotto Backups”, before every change.": "",
  "Chinotto can copy songs to this device over MTP (drag them onto it in the sidebar, or use Add Songs…) and delete them from it. Its playlists can't be changed yet.": "",
  "Chinotto can copy songs to this player (drag them onto it in the sidebar, or use Add Songs…) and delete them from it. Songs are put in Artist/Album folders inside its music folder.": "",
  "Chinotto can edit, add, and delete songs and change playlists on this iPod. It saves the ten most recent copies of the iPod's database to {path}.": "Concedi a Chinotto di eseguire modifiche alla biblioteca sull'iPod, inclusa l'abilità di trasferire o eliminare dei brani. Le ultime 10 copie del database iPod sono salvate qui: {path}",
  "Chinotto couldn't read this iPod's database": "",
  "Chinotto creates the iPod's database and folders, so it can take music. Nothing else on the drive is changed.": "",
  "Chinotto forgets this library and its list of songs. Your music files and folders aren't touched.": "",
  "Chinotto lists the music in these folders and keeps the list up to date (every hour, or with Scan Now). Your music files are never changed. Songs on a drive that isn't connected stay in the library until it's back.": "",
  "Chinotto only reads this device. Turn this on to copy songs to it and delete them. The setting is remembered for this device only.": "",
  "Chinotto only reads this iPod. Turn this on to edit songs, add or delete them and change playlists. The setting is remembered for this iPod only.": "",
  "Chinotto only reads this player. Turn this on to copy songs to it and delete them. The setting is remembered for this player only.": "",
  "Chinotto only reads this Walkman: its songs are in its Music list in the sidebar, and play from there. Turn this on to add, change and delete songs. The setting is remembered for this Walkman only.": "",
