  "Welcome to Chinotto! Ready? Plug in your digital audio player to begin! A classic, pre-iOS Apple iPod, an MTP device (such as a Creative Zen), or a Sony Walkman with OpenMG (most NW-A/S/E models) shows up here automatically. For any other drive-like player (most Sansa models, and older MSC Walkmans), click below to add it manually.": "",
